  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專案管理",
    "sub_ename": "PROJECT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在教授學生對軟體開發專案進行有效管理所需的技能和知識。課程內容包括專案計劃、進度追蹤、風險管理、資源分配、團隊合作和溝通策略等主題。學生將學習使用各種專案管理方法論，如敏捷開發和瀑布模型。透過案例研究和實際專案，學生將瞭解如何應對專案中的挑戰和問題，並學會使用專案管理工具和軟體。課程強調團隊合作、領導技能和問題解決能力的培養，使學生能夠在軟體開發領域中成功擔任專案管理職位，並提高專案交付的效率和質量。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to teach students the skills and knowledge necessary for effectively managing software development projects. Course content includes project planning, progress tracking, risk management, resource allocation, team collaboration, and communication strategies. Students will learn various project management methodologies, such as Agile and the Waterfall model. Through case studies and practical projects, students will understand how to address challenges and issues in projects and learn to use project management tools and software. The course emphasizes cultivating teamwork, leadership skills, and problem-solving abilities, enabling students to successfully assume project management positions in software development and improve project delivery efficiency and quality.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
